// Shared TRAQS logo assets — regenerated from the iOS artwork
// (Assets.xcassets/TRAQSLogo*.imageset, 2400x1200) so the wordmark matches the
// iOS app exactly. The previous crop was too tight at the bottom: ink reached the
// final pixel row, so the "q" descender was clipped to 16% of cap height instead
// of its true 29% — the tail was literally missing from the PNG.
//
// Cropped to the true ink bounds plus a 3% margin, so nothing touches an edge.
// Cap-height is 73.1% of canvas (was 71.5%), so the wordmark still renders at the
// same optical size for a given CSS height — only the tail is restored.
// Aspect ratio is 810:294 (2.755); the Fast TRAQS mask in
// TRAQS.jsx hard-codes this ratio, so update it there if these are regenerated.
//
// The "WHITE" variant is the cream wordmark intended for dark surfaces, the "BLUE"
// variant is the black wordmark intended for light surfaces. UL_LOGO_WHITE is the
// rendering target throughout the app (header, login, Fast TRAQS) and is theme-flipped
// via CSS filter: brightness(0) on light themes.
export const TRAQS_LOGO_BLUE  = "data:image/png;base64,";
export const TRAQS_LOGO_WHITE = "data:image/png;base64,";
export const UL_LOGO_WHITE    = "data:image/png;base64,";
